  "coder_notes": "Population: malignant glioma/high grade tumours of many types (paediatric-type tumours included); glioblastoma is not named, so high_grade_glioma_unspecified. Chemotherapy (thiotepa, etoposide, melphalan, fludarabine) coded supportive as conditioning for allogeneic HCT (cell therapy), by analogy with manual R6; if an adjudicator treats the conditioning regimen as the antitumour question, these would be experimental_combination. Medulloblastoma group 3/4 molecular subtype is mentioned in eligibility but is not a listed biomarker and not relevant to GBM; not coded. Cyclosporine appears only in the arm text as an alternative to tacrolimus."
